  "id": "woods",
  "displayName": "Woods",
  "curriculumIndex": 3,
  "teaches": [
    "leadAndDrop",
    "crosshairPlacement"
  ],
  "_intent": "Long sightlines, elevation, and concealment that is NOT cover -- foliage hides you and stops nothing. Maximum range means maximum time of flight, which means the lead and the holdover are both enormous. This is the pump marker's map and the final exam of the whole curriculum.",
